 target="_self" class="bt_bb_link" title="See All of Our Services"><span class="bt_bb_button_text" >See All of Our Services</span></a></div><div class="bt_bb_button bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_icon_position_left bt_bb_style_outline bt_bb_size_normal bt_bb_width_inline bt_bb_shape_inherit bt_bb_target_self bt_bb_align_inherit" style="; --primary-color:#d4a017; --secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_size_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_size_normal&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;,&quot;xl&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_align_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_align_inherit&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;xl&quot;:&quot;inherit&quot;}}"><a href="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/our-guarantee/" target="_self" class="bt_bb_link" title="Check out our 7 point Lifetime Guarantee"><span class="bt_bb_button_text" >Check out our 7 point Lifetime Guarantee</span></a></div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_medium" data-bt-override-class="null"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- cell_inner --></div><!-- cell --></div><!-- port --></section><section id="bt_bb_section6a9f3efba19da" class="bt_bb_section bt_bb_color_scheme_13 bt_bb_layout_boxed_1200 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_top_spacing_medium bt_bb_bottom_spacing_medium" style="; --section-primary-color:#181818; --section-secondary-color:#f9f9f9;" data-bt-override-class="null"><div class="bt_bb_port"><div class="bt_bb_cell"><div class="bt_bb_cell_inner"><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_center bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:12;" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h2 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >OUR PROJECTS</span></span></h2></header><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><div class="bt_bb_masonry_image_grid bt_bb_grid_container bt_bb_columns_3 bt_bb_gap_small" data-columns="3"><div class="bt_bb_masonry_post_image_content" data-columns="3"><div class="bt_bb_grid_sizer"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/outdoor-lights-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/outdoor-lights.jpg" data-title="outdoor-lights"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Alpine_entrance-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Alpine_entrance.jpg" data-title="Alpine_entrance"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Alpine_lights1-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Alpine_lights1.jpg" data-title="Alpine_lights1"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Laboratory_Bar-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Laboratory_Bar.jpg" data-title="Laboratory_Bar"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Jucy-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Jucy.jpg" data-title="Jucy"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/outdoor_deck_lights-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/outdoor_deck_lights.jpg" data-title="outdoor_deck_lights"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Paua_Co-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Paua_Co.jpg" data-title="Paua_Co"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/All_Souls_1-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/All_Souls_1.jpg" data-title="All_Souls_1"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item bt_bb_tile_format11" data-hw="0.625" data-src="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/southern_hospitality-640x400.jpg" data-src-full="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/southern_hospitality.jpg" data-title="southern_hospitality"><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner" data-hw="0.625" ><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_image"></div><div class="bt_bb_grid_item_inner_content"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><div class="bt_bb_button bt_bb_color_scheme_6 bt_bb_icon_position_left bt_bb_style_filled bt_bb_size_normal bt_bb_width_inline bt_bb_shape_inherit bt_bb_target_self bt_bb_align_inherit" style="; --primary-color:#ffffff; --secondary-color:#d4a017;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><a href="/projects" target="_self" class="bt_bb_link" title="View projects"><span class="bt_bb_button_text" >View projects</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- cell_inner --></div><!-- cell --></div><!-- port --></section><section id="bt_bb_section6a9f3efba2a97" class="bt_bb_section bt_bb_layout_boxed_1000 bt_bb_vertical_align_top"  data-bt-override-class="null"><div class="bt_bb_port"><div class="bt_bb_cell"><div class="bt_bb_cell_inner"><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:12;" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h2 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >ZERO FRUSTRATIONS - GUARANTEED!</span></span></h2></header><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_2 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#111112; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h4 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >From the moment you contact us we aim to make the process as clear and easy as possible</span></span></h4></header><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><div  class="bt_bb_text" ><p><strong>We pride ourselves on our level of communication</strong></p>
<p>From initially gathering the details of your job or project, through to scheduling and committing to being there on time, to the level of workmanship and advice you will receive.</p>
<p>Then from the administration side of the process we will ensure invoices are clear and easy to understand, sent through in a timely manner.</p>
<p>We will ensure your scheduled job is confirmed, and that you are happy with the final result.</p>
<p><strong>We believe our registered electricians are among the best in Canterbury</strong></p>
<p>They know that their role is not just as an electrician or technician that does a high-quality job on the tools, but one that also provides the right advice, one that that is a proactive problem solver and will also in general deliver a high-quality service, along with keeping our clients well informed along the way.</p>
<p>We are 100% Christchurch owned and operated. Based in <a href="http://skilledelectrical.co.nz/electrician-bromley/">Bromley</a>, we are ready to service all the Canterbury region. So, call us or call in to see us at our premises – 8 Moncur Place, Addington, Christchurch to discuss your electrical needs with our team.</p>
</div><div data-bb-version="5.0.1" class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal bt_bb_bottom_spacing_none" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_normal&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_none&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}"></div><div data-bb-version="5.0.1" class="bt_bb_button bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_icon_position_left bt_bb_style_outline bt_bb_size_normal bt_bb_width_inline bt_bb_shape_inherit bt_bb_target_self bt_bb_text_transform_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --primary-color:#d4a017; --secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_size_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_size_normal&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_align_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_align_center&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;center&quot;}}"><a href="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/our-guarantee/" target="_self" class="bt_bb_link" title="Check out our 7 point Lifetime Guarantee"><span class="bt_bb_button_text" >Check out our 7 point Lifetime Guarantee</span></a></div><div data-bb-version="5.0.1" class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_medium bt_bb_bottom_spacing_none" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_medium&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;medium&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_none&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_subheadline bt_bb_align_center" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h3 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >We are also a turnkey company with a full range of services</span></span></h3><div class="bt_bb_headline_subheadline">We have a full range of experienced and specialist installers working out of our base in Bromley, Christchurch.</div></header><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h6 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >Air Conditioning and Heat Pumps</span></span></h6></header><div  class="bt_bb_text" ><p>We have Air-conditioning and heat pump specialists in a separate division based in Christchurch. Here we can do everything from standard hi wall installations to the full design and installation of ducted air con units for both domestic and mid-sized commercial installations.</p>
</div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h6 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >Design and installation of Solar Systems</span></span></h6></header><div  class="bt_bb_text" ><p>We work very closely with Endless Energy, a sister company also based in <a href="http://skilledelectrical.co.nz/electrician-bromley/">Bromley</a>, Christchurch. By working in partnership, our electricians can design and install anything from a 3kW solar system to an exceptionally large 1 MW system.</p>
</div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h6 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >High-End Architectural Builds </span></span></h6></header><div  class="bt_bb_text" ><p>High-end Architectural builds require a specialised and detail-oriented electrician. Over the years we have successfully completed many of these in the Christchurch and Canterbury area. We have a small team that know how to deliver a high-end service and end result for this type of electrician work.</p>
</div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h6 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >Mining, Tunnels, Heavy Industrial</span></span></h6></header><div  class="bt_bb_text" ><p>With the owner/founder of Skilled having a mining background, we also have a Christchurch team that can put their hands to anything industrial having done various high-profile contracts in the South Island, from subcontracts at Fonterra, Edendale Dairy Factory, Christchurch Hospital, and tunneling project on the West Coast etc.</p>
</div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h6 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >In-House Electrical</span></span></h6></header><div  class="bt_bb_text" ><p>We have a design and build service for any domestic or commercial build again done from our Christchurch office as an additional service.</p>
<p>We have been servicing the greater Christchurch region for many years now, on all general electrical installations, which includes servicing and maintenance, switchboard upgrades, new additions, and renovators, data and coms, CCTV and security, and all things electrical.</p>
</div><div data-bb-version="5.0.1" class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_none&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;none&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;}}"></div><div data-bb-version="5.0.1" class="bt_bb_button bt_bb_color_scheme_6 bt_bb_icon_position_left bt_bb_style_filled bt_bb_size_normal bt_bb_width_inline bt_bb_shape_inherit bt_bb_target_self bt_bb_text_transform_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --primary-color:#ffffff; --secondary-color:#d4a017;" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_size_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_size_normal&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_align_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_align_center&quot;,&quot;def&quot;:&quot;center&quot;}}"><a href="/our-services/" target="_self" class="bt_bb_link" title="See All of Our Services"><span class="bt_bb_button_text" >See All of Our Services</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ></div></div><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:12;" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_medium" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h4 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >We all know that engaging an electrician can often be a frustrating and disappointing experience.</span></span></h4></header><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_subheadline bt_bb_align_center" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_headline_subheadline">Skilled Electrical make the process seamless and easy, so you can get on with the more important things, stress free.</div></header><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_medium" data-bt-override-class="null"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- cell_inner --></div><!-- cell --></div><!-- port --></section><section id="bt_bb_section6a9f3efba34bb" class="bt_bb_section bt_bb_layout_boxed_1200"  data-bt-override-class="null"><div class="bt_bb_port"><div class="bt_bb_cell"><div class="bt_bb_cell_inner"><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:12;" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- cell_inner --></div><!-- cell --></div><!-- port --></section><section id="bt_bb_section6a9f3efba360c" class="bt_bb_section bt_bb_layout_boxed_1200 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_top_spacing_normal bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal"  data-bt-override-class="null"><div class="bt_bb_port"><div class="bt_bb_cell"><div class="bt_bb_cell_inner"><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:12;" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h2 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >FAQ</span></span></h2></header><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion bt_bb_style_outline bt_bb_shape_square" data-closed=closed><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">1</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">WHY WOULD WE USE SKILLED ELECTRICAL OVER ANOTHER ELECTRICAL COMPANY?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>We always aim to be the easiest trade to deal with on any site.  We focus on only employing good people and have a commitment to giving superior service.  We offer a diverse range of <a href="https://www.www.skilledelectrical.co.nz/">electrical services</a> for residential, commercial and industrial customers and most of our business comes from our clients recommending us to others and repeat business.</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">2</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">WHAT SETS SKILLED ELECTRICAL APART?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>We have built our business on the fact that we do a great job.  We employ a large team of qualified electricians who all have Site Safe passports.  Our <a href="https://www.www.skilledelectrical.co.nz/our-guarantee.html">7 Point Guarantee</a> covers our workmanship for a lifetime and helps ensure our customers always get the best quality products and advice. Feel free to check our <a href="https://g.page/skilledelectrical">Google reviews</a> and, of course, leave your own feedback once your job is done.</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">3</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">IF WE WANT A JOB DONE THIS WEEK, CAN YOU DO IT?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>We pride ourselves on our ability to be flexible and accommodating. So, usually, we can fit in with your schedule.</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">4</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">COULD YOU GIVE ME A QUOTE FOR MY JOB?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>We can quote for any electrical work<span style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px">. Please fill out the form <a target="_blank">here</a>. The minimum charge for standard service visits is</span> $145 + GST.</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">5</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">HOW CAN YOU ENSURE THERE ARE NO UNEXPECTED BILLS OR HIDDEN COSTS ON MY PROJECT?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>If extra tasks are added to a project or something unforeseen arises, we undertake that any additional costs are given to you in writing on the same day or by the very next day.</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">6</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">WHERE DO YOU RECOMMEND WE GET LIGHT FITTINGS FOR OUR PROJECT?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>We don’t mind where you go for light fittings, however, we do recommend you consult with us first as we can often supply you with superior quality fittings at a better price.  In particular, downlights and standard wall lights. We use trusted suppliers who know our high standards, so you can be sure of the quality of fittings we use.</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item"><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_number">7</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_title">WHAT CAN WE DO IN THE WAY OF PREVENTATIVE MAINTENANCE ON OUR PROPERTY TO MAKE IT SAFER?</div><div class="bt_bb_accordion_item_content"><div  class="bt_bb_text" >
<p>We recommend every property goes through an annual “Electrical Warrant of Fitness”. This involves several tests to ensure the electrical system has the necessary protection for its ongoing safety, a visual inspection and, most critically, checking and tightening connections, particularly at the switchboard and on any essential equipment.  Connections loosen over time and this is the biggest cause of electrical fires by far.<br />
For commercial and industrial clients, we can set up a maintenance programme to suit your particular business or property.</p>
</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_row "  data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:12;" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_medium" data-bt-override-class="null"></div><header class="bt_bb_headline bt_bb_color_scheme_4 bt_bb_dash_none bt_bb_size_inherit bt_bb_align_center" style="; --headline-primary-color:#d4a017; --headline-secondary-color:#ffffff;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><h6 class="bt_bb_headline_tag"><span class="bt_bb_headline_content"><span >Book Your &quot;no hassles - guaranteed&quot; Electrician in Christchurch Now on 03-382-1668</span></span></h6></header><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_medium" data-bt-override-class="null"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- cell_inner --></div><!-- cell --></div><!-- port --></section></div><span id="bt_bb_fe_preview_toggler" class="bt_bb_fe_preview_toggler" title="Edit/Preview"></span>		</div><!-- /boldthemes_content -->
 
	</div><!-- /contentHolder -->
</div><!-- /contentWrap -->

<div data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="btSiteFooter">

